Record the layer inputs of Mistral Small 4 (which reuses the deepseek2
graph) so that DFlash and DSpark drafters can read hidden states from it.
Without this, llama-server aborts on the first request with:
  GGML_ASSERT(t_layer_inp[il] != nullptr && "layer input tensor is null")
Same change as the existing one in src/models/qwen3.cpp. Apply to llama.cpp
v0.8.0 with "patch -p1".

AI Disclosure:
- Authorship: Autonomous
- Models: claude-sonnet-5-5 (Anthropic)
- Scope: Wrote this patch so speculative decoding works with Mistral Small 4
  for the user's request for optimized Mistral Small 4 images.
- References: https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/30927 (similar fix)

